cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Open3DPP in your research or derivative work, please cite it as below."
title: "Open3DPP: Open Data Standard for FFF/FDM Polymer Printing"
abstract: >-
  Open3DPP is an open data standard for FFF/FDM polymer 3D printing — a flat
  characterization schema for recording material identity, composition, print
  conditions (temperatures as ranges), part geometry as a first-class axis,
  microstructural mediators, mechanical properties with per-property
  uncertainty, moisture response, and provenance. One row is one observation:
  a settings card, a measured specimen, or a moisture response.
type: software
